{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38607","headline":"题画柏 · 吴融","name":"题画柏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不得月中桂，转思陵上柏。\n闲取画图看，烦纡果冰释。\n桂生在青冥，万古烟雾隔。\n下荫玄兔窟，上暎嫦娥魄。\n圆缺且不常，高低图难测。\n若非假羽翰，折攀何由得。\n天远眼虚穿，夜阑头自白。\n未知陵上柏，一定不移易。\n有意兼松茂，无情从麝食。\n不在是非间，与人爲愤激。\n他年上缣素，今日悬屋壁。\n灵怪不可知，风雨疑来逼。\n明朝归故园，唯此同所适。\n回首寄团枝，无劳惠消息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}